    "description": "<p>This is the reader-facing SGA working record for the Modern LaTeX Editions of Mathematics Manuscripts project. It contains modern LaTeX working editions, French source-repair workpasses, machine-assisted English and Spanish translations, source witnesses, build evidence, and audit material for SGA 5 and SGA 6.</p><p><strong>Open first:</strong> <code>00_SGA5_English_SourceChecked_WorkingTranslation_NotCritical_20260717.pdf</code>, the current 309-page source-aware SGA 5 English working translation. The record also directly exposes <code>02b_SGA5_Spanish_SourceReconciled_WorkingTranslation_Through_ExposeXV_Lemma3_NotCritical_20260718.pdf</code>, the new 304-page Spanish checkpoint; <code>02_SGA6_English_FullRange_Layered_WorkingReader_CORRECTED_20260718.pdf</code>, the corrected 381-page SGA 6 English reader; and <code>01_SGA6_French_SourceRescribe_Workpass_NotCertified_idx684_20260718.pdf</code>, the current 374-page French SGA 6 source-rescribe checkpoint.</p><p><strong>SGA 5 Spanish update:</strong> this version replaces the checkpoint through Expose XV Proposition 1 with a 356-unit, 304-page source-reconciled working reader. It integrates complete Exposes I, III A, III B, V, VI, VII, VIII, X, and XII, then Expose XV through section 3 no. 2, the rationality theorem, and complete Lemmas 1--3. The expanded TeX target is bound by SHA-256, a clean build reports zero forbidden diagnostics, and pages 302--304 passed hash-bound Poppler inspection. The next ordered cursor is the three reductions beginning at French authority line 15068. Sixteen later live-workspace drafts are excluded.</p><p><strong>SGA 6 English authority layers:</strong> source-PDF 001--525 uses an inherited English control that is partially source-synchronized but not globally source-checked; idx532--662 is source-checked against the directly checked French workpass available for that range; idx663--702 and terminal matter are scan-checked English draft layers pending later French reconciliation. The bounded Spanish SGA 6 Expose X tranche for idx532--537 is retained.</p><p><strong>French workpasses:</strong> the SGA 6 linear pagewise pass remains frozen at public idx684 / volume p. 671 / Expose XIV p. 5. The French SGA 5 workpass remains an authority layer with explicit caveats. Their grouped ZIPs retain editable TeX, ledgers, source witnesses, render checks, compile evidence, and checksums.</p><p><strong>Status:</strong> these are substantive machine-assisted, source-aware working editions and translations, not OCR-only output. They are not independently human-certified critical editions, complete SGA translations, whole-volume source-faithfulness certifications, publication-grade proofread editions, or diagram-by-diagram certifications. Known and unknown mathematical or diagram errors may remain. Corrections can be proposed through the <a href=\"https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts\">GitHub mirror</a>.</p>",
    "additional_descriptions": [
      {
        "description": "Reader-first SGA 5 and SGA 6 working surface. This version replaces the earlier Spanish SGA 5 checkpoint with a 296-page, 345-unit source-reconciled reader through Expose XV section 2, no. 1 and the complete proof of Proposition 1. SGA 6 French remains at public idx684 and SGA 6 English retains separated authority layers. Not a completed or critical edition, whole-volume source-faithfulness certification, or diagram-by-diagram certification.",
        "type": {
